{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748070/extras/animals_idle.gif?t=1748047403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Click with Ease, Enjoy with Pleasure!</strong> \ud83d\udc3e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adorable little animals are swarming into your home in droves! Grab your mouse and start the battle! Just click on three matching animals to eliminate them. <strong>No complicated operations needed</strong>\u2014start fighting anytime, anywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Challenge Levels, Infinite Fun!</strong> \ud83c\udfaf</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock <strong>21 super cute little animals</strong> in the game. They may look adorable, but don't underestimate their \u201cinvasion\u201d speed! Keep an eye on your health during the battle. Come and challenge your limits to see how far you can go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>With one mouse in hand, fun is at your fingertips! Come and experience this simple yet super fun game!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3748070?t=1748047403","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3748070?t=1748047403","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748070/97f0be4286b439adabfe23398b1169e20f5d9256/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748047403","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748070/97f0be4286b439adabfe23398b1169e20f5d9256/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748047403","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3748410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat